 "description": "<div><p>This dataset includes all of the voting places available to voters for the 2017 by-election. Since 2014, voters can vote at any voting place within the City. </p><p>Prior to the 2014 municipal election, the city was divided into voting divisions and voters were required to vote at a designated voting place within their assigned voting division.</p><p>The City operates an at-large voting system. </p><p>\n<strong>Note:</strong></p><p>UBC Lands and UEL residents are only eligible to vote for School Trustees.</p>\n</div> <h3>Data currency</h3><div><p>​​These are the voting places used for the City's 2017 municipal by-election during Advance Voting and on General Voting Day.</p></div> <h3>Websites for further information</h3><div><ul><li>​<a href=\"https://opendata.vancouver.ca/explore/dataset/municipal-election-results/\">Municipal election results</a></li></ul></div>",
